# DS5005: a column written as a string gets a fix that removes the quotes.
mode: check
schema: t(customerId: string, month: datetime, revenue: real, n: long)
---- query
from t
| render timechart with (xcolumn = "month")
---- expected
error[DS5005]: `xcolumn` takes column names
  --> query:2:36
  |
2 | | render timechart with (xcolumn = "month")
  |                                    ^^^^^^^ this is not a column name
  |
  = help: a column name is written without string quotes: `month`
